  "name": "入场强调 · 消散重影",
  "provenance": "Original editable typography study, native text and motion rather than extracted reference imagery. White headline with two opposed chromatic reading replicas. Generic5% font-size outline, main shadow2% font-size blur/offset at20% opacity,160ms entrance and100ms exit. All layers share content and typography; no case-specific words or keyframes. Short events use native phase compression and require fresh reading-budget verification. Revision8 cleans the current usage contract without changing the revision7 visual graph; no review score or aesthetic approval inherited.",
